    {
      "id": "n_nwq_biology_class_day_7",
      "next": "n_nwq_biology_class_day_7_2",
      "text": "$name and $ally head to biology class. Mr. Kinsey announces that today, to finish off flower anatomy, the class will be starting group projects."
    },
    {
