      "next": "n_nwq_biology_class_day_7_3",
      "text": "$name groans. Group projects are the worst. $name and $ally form a team of 3 with their classmate $bioteam."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_biology_class_day_7_3",
      "next": "n_nwq_biology_class_day_7_4",
      "text": "Start on the"
    },
    {
