      "text": "}"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_defend_gender_biology_4",
      "next": "n_nwq_defend_gender_biology_5",
      "text": "After class, $ally apologizes to $name for"
    },
    {
      "choices": [
        {
          "goto": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology",
          "id": "c_nwq_putting_obj_on_the",
          "text": "putting $obj on the spot"
        }
      ],
      "id": "n_nwq_defend_gender_biology_5",
      "text": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_don_39_t_defend_gender_biology",
      "next": "n_nwq_don_39_t_defend_gender_biology_2",
      "text": "$name feels awkward about it, so $sbj decides not to explain anything to $bioteam."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_don_39_t_defend_gender_biology_2",
      "next": "n_nwq_don_39_t_defend_gender_biology_3",
      "text": "$name: \"Oh, don't worry about it, $bioteam.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_don_39_t_defend_gender_biology_3",
      "next": "n_nwq_don_39_t_defend_gender_biology_4",
      "text": "$bioteam frowns but doesn't say anything more. $ally almost seems disapointed, but $name can't tell if $sbj's imagining it."
    },
    {
      "choices": [
        {
          "goto": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology",
          "id": "c_nwq_putting_obj_on_the_2",
          "text": "putting $obj on the spot"
        }
      ],
      "id": "n_nwq_don_39_t_defend_gender_biology_4",
      "text": "Regardless, the three work on their poster. After class, $ally apologizes to $name for"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_2",
      "text": "$ally pulls $name aside before they have to get to their next class."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_2",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_3",
      "text": "$ally: \"Hey, $name, I'm sorry about putting you on the spot there.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_3",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_4",
      "text": "$name: \"It wasn't your fault, $ally. It's nice of you to apologize, though.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_4",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_5",
      "text": "$ally: \"Well, it just doesn't feel right to expose you like that. I'll try to remember next time.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_5",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_6",
      "text": "$name: \"I mean,"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_6",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_7",
      "showIf": {
        "flag": "defbio",
        "type": "flag",
        "value": false
      },
      "text": "I was just nervous just now, but"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_7",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_8",
      "text": "I should be acting more like myself, right? If I'm not afraid to be a $noun, then you won't have to watch yourself.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_8",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_9",
      "text": "$ally: \"Well, you should do it on your terms. Anyway, see you at lunch!\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_9",
      "next": "n_nwq_ryan_apologizes_biology_10",
      "text": "$name says goodbye to $ally and heads to"
    },
    {
      "choices": [
        {
          "goto": "n_nwq_history_class_day_7",
          "id": "c_nwq_pos_next_class",
          "text": "$pos next class"
