    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_history_class_day_7",
      "next": "n_nwq_history_class_day_7_2",
      "text": "Today in history class, Mr. Coulter is"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_history_class_day_7_2",
      "next": "n_nwq_history_class_day_7_3",
      "text": ". $name writes a poem about"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_history_class_day_7_3",
      "next": "n_nwq_history_class_day_7_4",
      "text": "in $pos notebook."
    },
    {
      "choices": [
        {
          "goto": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7",
          "id": "c_nwq_go_to_lunch_6",
          "text": "Go to lunch"
        }
      ],
      "id": "n_nwq_history_class_day_7_4",
      "text": "//History is// so //boring//."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7",
      "next": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_2",
      "text": "$name hangs out with $ally at lunch. $ally takes a bite of $pos cafeteria sloppy joe and $name hesitantly decides to ask $obj a question."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_2",
      "next": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_3",
      "text": "$name: \"Hey, $ally. Why did you, um, want to be my friend?\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_3",
      "next": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_4",
      "text": "$ally looks down at $pos messy sandwich. \"When I moved here, I left everything behind,\" $sbj said. \"Sure, the kids at my old school were pricks, but I had friends, too. I didn't have anything here.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_4",
      "next": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_5",
      "text": "$name: \"Oh.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_5",
      "next": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_6",
      "text": "$ally: \"But then I saw you on the bus, the quiet kid from art class with those deep, introspective sculptures. You reminded me of my old friends. I thought if I could just get you to talk to me, you'd see that I was an interesting person. Then maybe I wouldn't be so lonely anymore.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_6",
      "next": "n_nwq_lunch_day_7_7",
      "text": "$name: \"You are an interesting person, $ally.\""
    },
